    <item>
      <title>Version 0.1.28</title>
      <sparkle:version>0.1.28</sparkle:version>
      <pubDate>Thu, 06 Aug 2026 08:25:30 +0000</pubDate>
      <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>13.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
      <description sparkle:format="markdown">
## Added

- Show an English change list in Sparkle update prompts and GitHub Releases.

## Fixed

- Keep mixed recognition running through Web ASR when the Android route cannot start.
- Restore bundled demo audio lookup for recognition diagnostics and log exports in packaged apps.
- Show the actual recognition failure instead of labeling every startup error as a network interruption.
- Prevent overlapping Android recognition sessions and retry concurrency quota failures once.
- Keep Settings and menu login status synchronized when the login state changes.
      </description>
      <enclosure
        url="https://github.com/rhinoc/douvo/releases/download/v0.1.28/douvo-0.1.28-macos.dmg"
